          "type": 10,
          "content": "## <:lasrp:1559999109669191811>┃Los Angeles State Roleplay Assistance\n\n> Welcome to the **Los Angeles State Roleplay** Assistance Centre. If you require help, have a question, or need to raise a concern, please select the appropriate category from the dropdown menu below.\n\n**Available Assistance Categories**\n\n> **Department Assistance** — For department-related enquiries, applications, internal concerns, and other department matters.\n\n> **General Assistance** — For general questions, community support, server-related issues, and other enquiries.\n\n> **High Rank Assistance** — For serious concerns that require attention from high-ranking staff, including staff complaints, management matters, and escalated issues.\n\n> Please ensure you select the correct category so your request can be directed to the appropriate team. **Providing clear and accurate information will help us assist you more efficiently.**"
